OL,3,GNEWSANo evidence of cancer rise in
OL,4,Atoxic town - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent report has found "no
OL,7,Fclear evidence" of higher than expected
OL,8,Fcancer rates among children and young
OL,9,Fadults in a town at the centre of a
OL,10,Ftoxic waste scandal.
OL,12,FDust from work to dismantle the former
OL,13,Fsteelworks in Corby, Northamptonshire,
OL,14,Fis believed to have caused birth
OL,15,Fdefects and many families suspect
OL,16,Fpollution is also behind childhood
OL,17,Fcancers.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
