OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1793276782
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSANo evidence of cancer rise in
OL,4,Atoxic town - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Disease Registration
OL,7,FService (NDRS) found cancer rates among
OL,8,Fadults and children living within 5km
OL,9,F(3.1 miles) of Deene Quarry were not
OL,10,Fhigher or lower than those seen in the
OL,11,Frest of Corby, the East Midlands or
OL,12,FEngland.
OL,14,FNorth Northamptonshire Council said the
OL,15,Freport was a "comprehensive analysis"
OL,16,Fof the data.
